# Institutional Digital Repository & E-Library Style Guide

## Design Specifications

### Border & Radius
- All borders: 2px solid
- Border color: #CBD5E1 (institutional gray-200)
- Border radius: 4px (crisp corners)
- Table borders: collapsed with 2px spacing

### Color Palette
- Primary institutional blue: #1E3A8A (deep)
- Secondary: #3B82F6 (blue-500)
- Accent: #EF4444 (red-500 for alerts)
- Light background: #F8FAFC (gray-50)
- Medium background: #E2E8F0 (gray-200)
- Text color: #1E293B (gray-900)
- Muted text: #64748B (gray-500)

### Typography
- Font family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif
- Font size: 14px base, 16px medium, 18px large
- Line height: 1.5 for paragraphs, 1.25 for tables

### Table Styles
- High-density tables with minimal spacing
- Zebra striping: alternate row bg #F1F5F9 (gray-100)
- Hover state: bg #CBD5E1 with text #1E293B
- Focus state: outline: 2px solid #3B82F6

### Component Guidelines
- Buttons: rounded corners, 2px border, hover bg-opacity-80
- Cards: max-width 640px, rounded 4px, shadow sm
- Forms: input border 2px, focus ring 2px #3B82F6
- Modals: centered, padded, max-h-screen overflow-y-auto

### Layout
- Max-width containers: 1400px wide, centered with auto margins
- Grid gap: 16px between columns
- Padding: 1rem horizontal, 1.5rem vertical on sections

### Accessibility
- Contrast ratio: minimum 4.5:1 for normal text
- Focus visible: 2px outline on interactive elements
- Skip links available at top of page

### Institutional Branding
- Header height: 60px with 2px bottom border #CBD5E1
- Logo max-height: 32px
- Footer bg: #0F172A (gray-900), text: #94A3B8 (gray-300)